WEBVTT

01:49.920 --> 01:53.900
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.310 --> 01:56.800
[Episode 16]

01:59.870 --> 02:00.510
Mr. Xiao.

02:04.040 --> 02:05.310
Mr. Hu is right.

02:07.640 --> 02:08.190
Hu Xiu.

02:09.080 --> 02:10.240
I wish you a new year

02:14.630 --> 02:15.890
free from all worries.

02:20.680 --> 02:21.020
Cheers.

02:21.020 --> 02:21.530
Cheers.

02:58.079 --> 03:00.150
Celebrating the New Year
in the lane this time

03:00.150 --> 03:01.880
feels pretty nice, doesn't it?

03:06.470 --> 03:07.950
All those wishes

03:08.470 --> 03:10.430
my parents made at dinner just now weren't

03:10.430 --> 03:12.120
what I truly wanted.

03:12.630 --> 03:14.830
Rather than a peaceful and smooth life,

03:15.520 --> 03:17.079
I prefer challenges.

03:18.910 --> 03:19.840
This year,

03:20.079 --> 03:22.280
I want to complete
Lyman's projects perfectly.

03:22.280 --> 03:23.910
If I get the chance,

03:24.190 --> 03:26.790
I also want to work
on projects of my own design.

03:27.240 --> 03:28.150
I want to

03:28.470 --> 03:30.240
hone my professional skills.

03:31.150 --> 03:32.410
I want to do more things

03:32.820 --> 03:34.470
I haven't tried before.

03:36.240 --> 03:37.000
I want...

03:42.240 --> 03:43.100
What about you?

03:43.630 --> 03:47.090
Is there anything you're determined
to accomplish this year?

03:47.800 --> 03:48.800
I want to...

03:51.840 --> 03:53.000
Find that answer.

04:12.910 --> 04:14.360
Don't torment yourself.

04:15.280 --> 04:17.240
I believe you'll find it.

04:21.750 --> 04:23.210
-When did I...
-Watch out.

05:42.300 --> 05:44.100
The Design Competition is over.

05:44.420 --> 05:45.210
I'll move out

05:45.590 --> 05:46.350
in a few days.

05:49.310 --> 05:50.600
What do you mean?

05:55.150 --> 05:56.880
I'll terminate my lease early.

06:26.710 --> 06:29.070
[The Xincheng Stadium collapsed.]

07:39.310 --> 07:44.420
♪ I saw the tram
driving under the sunset ♪

07:46.970 --> 07:51.980
♪ Like walking into a pause in a summer ♪

07:53.730 --> 07:56.740
♪ At this moment, the sunset is gentle ♪

07:57.540 --> 08:00.190
♪ I look up and press the shutter ♪

08:01.560 --> 08:08.690
♪ I take a piece of cloud
from your city as a memory ♪

08:09.680 --> 08:14.490
♪ Looking at the people
in skyscrapers leaving work ♪

08:16.880 --> 08:22.000
♪ Leaving a hurried silhouette
for the dusk ♪

08:23.860 --> 08:27.210
♪ Talking about random topics ♪

08:27.450 --> 08:30.870
♪ Waiting for the traffic light at dusk ♪

08:39.970 --> 08:41.059
Is that necessary?

08:41.210 --> 08:44.270
I scared him so much
that he doesn't even dare to show up.

08:57.320 --> 08:58.080
Mr. Gong?

08:58.720 --> 08:59.630
What are you doing here?

08:59.630 --> 09:00.890
Happy New Year, Hu Xiu.

09:00.920 --> 09:02.720
I'm here to help Xiao Zhiyu move.

09:04.080 --> 09:05.340
He's moving out today?

09:05.430 --> 09:06.440
Yeah.

09:06.440 --> 09:08.010
Can you believe it?
During the New Year holiday,

09:08.010 --> 09:10.470
he's asking me to work
like a moving company.

09:12.440 --> 09:13.770
He didn't tell you that?

09:20.480 --> 09:21.480
What do you mean?

09:22.300 --> 09:23.280
I've been busy these days,

09:23.280 --> 09:24.260
so I asked him to go there to help.

09:24.260 --> 09:26.660
You know that's not
what I'm talking about.

09:33.550 --> 09:34.120
Fine,

09:34.420 --> 09:35.140
I get it.

09:40.750 --> 09:41.480
Hu Xiu.

09:42.630 --> 09:44.240
I've finished moving everything.

09:44.240 --> 09:45.360
This key of his...

09:45.360 --> 09:46.030
I...

09:46.790 --> 09:48.000
I'm hanging it by your door.

09:48.000 --> 09:50.600
See if there's anything else
you need to check.

09:53.120 --> 09:54.120
This is his stuff.

09:54.150 --> 09:54.790
Take it away.

09:54.790 --> 09:55.270
Okay.

09:55.270 --> 09:56.530
So, for the New Year...

10:07.510 --> 10:08.270
What's wrong with you?

10:08.270 --> 10:09.880
You are actually free today.

10:09.910 --> 10:11.910
But why did you still boss me around?

10:19.930 --> 10:21.670
Well, I can tell
even if you don't tell me.

10:21.670 --> 10:23.930
The faces of you two already gave it away.

10:25.720 --> 10:26.780
What's up with her?

10:27.010 --> 10:28.960
She's like a firecracker
that didn't get set off on New Year's Eve,

10:28.960 --> 10:30.100
ready to blow any minute

10:30.100 --> 10:31.360
without holding back.

10:32.200 --> 10:32.870
Listen, Xiao,

10:32.870 --> 10:34.480
did you provoke her again?

10:34.650 --> 10:38.580
Or why would anyone throw a temper tantrum
during the New Year holiday?

11:10.080 --> 11:11.000
So...

11:12.670 --> 11:13.670
You mean

11:13.910 --> 11:15.970
you want to seek cooperation with me?

11:16.070 --> 11:16.720
Yes.

11:17.930 --> 11:19.190
But I have 1 condition.

11:22.500 --> 11:25.160
Our cooperation
needs to be kept confidential.

11:29.510 --> 11:30.640
Hu Xiu, good luck back at work.

11:30.640 --> 11:31.900
Good luck back at work.

11:32.510 --> 11:34.240
Mr. Sun, good luck back at work.

11:44.010 --> 11:44.600
Mr. Xiao,

11:44.910 --> 11:45.440
morning.

11:46.910 --> 11:47.440
Morning.

11:51.480 --> 11:53.000
You terminated your lease early.

11:53.000 --> 11:55.290
I'll refund you the unused rent
based on the remaining days.

11:55.290 --> 11:56.220
There's no need.

11:59.110 --> 12:01.570
I got your bank account number
from Mr. Gong.

12:04.820 --> 12:06.350
It's not much money anyway.

12:09.390 --> 12:11.720
I just don't like leaving things unclear.

12:15.370 --> 12:16.770
Mr. Pei, this way please.

12:21.320 --> 12:22.120
Good morning,

12:22.320 --> 12:22.960
Mr. Xiao.

12:24.440 --> 12:25.240
Ms. Hu.

12:42.840 --> 12:43.390
Mr. Xiao.

12:46.330 --> 12:47.330
This way, please.

12:48.240 --> 12:48.960
Thank you.

12:51.910 --> 12:52.630
Mr. Pei,

12:53.030 --> 12:55.440
Everyone here is part of the core team
making Lyman's projects.

12:55.440 --> 12:56.480
Sun Yifei.

12:56.480 --> 12:57.150
Tan Siyu.

12:57.150 --> 12:57.790
Hu Xiu.

12:59.480 --> 13:00.410
Hello everyone.

13:00.540 --> 13:02.020
Mr. Pei, you only brought

13:02.050 --> 13:03.440
one assistant with you today?

13:03.440 --> 13:04.480
Actually, no.

13:05.030 --> 13:06.600
Let them in when they're ready.

13:06.600 --> 13:07.860
Just a moment, please.

13:11.090 --> 13:11.970
Mr. Pei.

13:16.660 --> 13:17.800
Since this is our first collaboration,

13:17.800 --> 13:19.280
and it happens to be the New Year,

13:19.280 --> 13:21.480
I've prepared some gifts for everyone.

13:21.630 --> 13:23.430
This doesn't seem appropriate.

13:23.550 --> 13:24.630
Don't worry, guys.

13:24.630 --> 13:26.290
These gifts aren't expensive.

13:26.290 --> 13:28.290
Just a small token of sincerity.

13:29.120 --> 13:29.960
Ms. Zhou,

13:31.070 --> 13:32.030
this is for you.

13:33.670 --> 13:34.320
I've long heard

13:34.320 --> 13:36.440
that you graduated
from the Wharton School.

13:36.440 --> 13:37.750
Not only are you professionally competent,

13:37.750 --> 13:39.550
but you also
handle things very efficiently.

13:39.550 --> 13:40.360
So,

13:40.360 --> 13:41.720
a beautiful career woman's shoes

13:41.720 --> 13:42.840
must be well-maintained

13:42.840 --> 13:44.390
so that they can help you go

13:44.390 --> 13:45.200
more steadily

13:45.200 --> 13:45.930
and further.

13:47.150 --> 13:47.870
Thank you.

13:47.870 --> 13:48.750
Happy New Year.

13:49.030 --> 13:50.490
A few years ago, in Pudong,

13:50.950 --> 13:52.410
there was a theater project

13:52.410 --> 13:54.740
that I wanted to work on
with Engineer Sun.

13:55.100 --> 13:57.310
Unexpectedly, D Studio got ahead of us.

13:57.550 --> 13:58.240
This time,

13:58.630 --> 14:00.600
I can finally fulfill one of my wishes.

14:00.600 --> 14:01.860
Open it and take a look.

14:02.040 --> 14:03.440
It's a luxury brand.

14:04.750 --> 14:05.210
This...

14:05.510 --> 14:06.120
This is

14:06.120 --> 14:07.790
from a very famous Italian design company.

14:07.790 --> 14:08.390
That's right.

14:08.390 --> 14:10.990
This is the ruler
their designers use for work.

14:11.030 --> 14:13.770
I heard that you, Engineer Sun,
love collecting work tools.

14:13.770 --> 14:15.120
Their director is my friend,

14:15.120 --> 14:16.780
so I specially got one for you.

14:21.510 --> 14:22.290
Thank you, Mr. Pei.

14:22.290 --> 14:23.170
That's so nice of you.

14:23.170 --> 14:24.120
Don't mention it.

14:24.120 --> 14:24.920
Engineer Tan,

14:24.960 --> 14:25.510
this one is for you.

14:25.510 --> 14:26.150
Thank you.

14:26.150 --> 14:27.410
Everyone, have a seat.

14:38.150 --> 14:39.350
I learned that you like sweets

14:39.350 --> 14:41.030
at the cocktail party that day,

14:41.030 --> 14:42.960
so I had my staff
ask the chef from that day

14:42.960 --> 14:44.490
to make you some chocolate.

14:44.680 --> 14:45.410
Give it a try.

14:51.030 --> 14:51.720
Thanks.

14:52.230 --> 14:53.490
Happy to work with you.

14:55.120 --> 14:57.830
Mr. Pei, you're really thoughtful
about these things.

14:57.830 --> 14:59.720
Well, I'm here for business after all.

14:59.720 --> 15:00.920
It's what I should do.

15:01.550 --> 15:02.360
By the way,

15:03.200 --> 15:04.600
I know very little about you,

15:04.600 --> 15:05.840
Mr. Xiao,

15:06.200 --> 15:07.800
and I really don't know what you like.

15:07.800 --> 15:09.000
I hope you don't mind?

15:16.750 --> 15:18.830
Mr. Pei, let's skip the small talk.

15:19.120 --> 15:20.080
Since we're working together,

15:20.080 --> 15:21.490
let's focus on efficiency

15:21.490 --> 15:22.750
and start the meeting.

15:30.390 --> 15:32.430
I have no objections to today's agenda.

15:32.430 --> 15:33.320
Zhuling will offer

15:33.320 --> 15:34.720
the list of building material suppliers

15:34.720 --> 15:36.030
and their qualification reports
to your company

15:36.030 --> 15:36.840
as soon as possible.

15:36.840 --> 15:37.260
Good.

15:37.370 --> 15:39.770
Then we'll wait for Zhuling's submission.

15:40.320 --> 15:41.390
There's one more thing.

15:41.390 --> 15:42.390
Mr. Xie mentioned

15:42.670 --> 15:43.910
that before the studio and Zhuling

15:43.910 --> 15:45.510
formally sign the contract,

15:45.870 --> 15:48.320
we need to submit our financial statements
from the past year respectively

15:48.320 --> 15:49.840
to Lyman for review

15:49.960 --> 15:52.100
so as to ensure transparency
in our cooperation.

15:52.100 --> 15:54.150
We've already submitted
our financial statement.

15:54.150 --> 15:56.480
Please submit yours soon as well, Mr. Pei.

15:58.550 --> 15:59.240
No problem.

16:00.510 --> 16:01.480
Well,

16:01.480 --> 16:01.960
if there's nothing else,

16:01.960 --> 16:03.820
let's conclude today's meeting.

16:04.200 --> 16:04.910
How about

16:04.910 --> 16:05.510
I treat everyone

16:05.510 --> 16:06.840
to a meal?

16:08.870 --> 16:10.730
We have many more meetings to hold,

16:10.730 --> 16:11.930
so we'll have to pass.

16:17.870 --> 16:18.400
Alright,

16:18.420 --> 16:19.880
I will leave you to it then.

16:22.630 --> 16:23.550
Let's exchange WeChat contacts

16:23.550 --> 16:24.960
for future collaboration.

16:24.960 --> 16:25.800
How about this?

16:25.800 --> 16:26.580
I'll create a group chat

16:26.580 --> 16:28.140
for the designers to add you.

16:28.140 --> 16:28.800
No problem.

16:31.390 --> 16:31.960
Mr. Pei,

16:31.960 --> 16:33.000
I've created the group chat,

16:33.000 --> 16:34.270
and all the designers have added you.

16:34.270 --> 16:34.790
Okay.

16:43.360 --> 16:44.120
Ms. Hu,

16:44.510 --> 16:45.390
I've added you.

16:54.080 --> 16:55.540
We couldn't have lunch together today.

16:55.540 --> 16:57.470
Hope we can have a chance next time.

17:00.180 --> 17:01.240
Take care, Mr. Pei.

17:09.270 --> 17:10.569
This time, you did a great job

17:10.569 --> 17:12.500
on the studio's background check.

17:14.440 --> 17:15.640
It's my duty, Mr. Pei.

17:16.550 --> 17:17.349
However,

17:17.550 --> 17:19.069
regarding Ms. Hu's background check,

17:19.069 --> 17:21.000
I couldn't find much information.

17:21.200 --> 17:22.030
She?

17:22.970 --> 17:24.900
You don't need to investigate her.

17:40.040 --> 17:45.150
♪ I saw the tram
driving under the sunset ♪

17:47.700 --> 17:52.710
♪ Like walking into a pause in a summer ♪

17:49.310 --> 17:50.110
Good morning,

17:50.310 --> 17:51.030
Mr. Xiao.

17:51.670 --> 17:52.460
Ms. Hu.

17:54.460 --> 17:57.470
♪ At this moment, the sunset is gentle ♪

17:58.270 --> 18:00.920
♪ I look up and press the shutter ♪

18:02.290 --> 18:09.420
♪ I take a piece of cloud
from your city as a memory ♪

18:10.410 --> 18:15.220
♪ Looking at the people
in skyscrapers leaving work ♪

18:17.610 --> 18:22.730
♪ Leaving a hurried silhouette
for the dusk ♪

18:22.020 --> 18:22.670
Mr. Xiao,

18:22.840 --> 18:24.430
I've checked today's schedule.

18:24.430 --> 18:25.740
There are no other meetings at the moment.

18:24.590 --> 18:27.940
♪ Talking about random topics ♪

18:26.070 --> 18:27.310
Is there any arrangement

18:27.310 --> 18:28.590
that I haven't been updated on?

18:28.180 --> 18:31.600
♪ Waiting for the traffic light at dusk ♪

18:32.100 --> 18:38.920
♪ To the left or to the right,
not about eternity ♪

18:34.110 --> 18:35.370
I'll arrange it later.

18:38.110 --> 18:38.720
Okay.

18:39.500 --> 18:41.500
♪ I'm missing you so much ♪

18:41.590 --> 18:45.910
♪ And wondering what kind of life
you're living right now ♪

18:46.730 --> 18:51.520
♪ I can only hear about your recent life
through gossip ♪

18:53.680 --> 19:00.540
♪ We pass by one another
in the bustling streets ♪

19:00.850 --> 19:06.690
♪ Life is pushing us
into the paths yet unknown ♪

19:11.720 --> 19:12.270
Dad,

19:12.680 --> 19:13.440
I'm home.

19:14.720 --> 19:16.000
I heard from Shen Jie

19:16.440 --> 19:20.440
that Lyman wants the financial statement
of Zhuling from the past year.

19:23.960 --> 19:24.510
Yes.

19:26.270 --> 19:27.270
Mr. Xie knows

19:27.440 --> 19:29.300
my relationship with Xiao Zhiyu.

19:29.720 --> 19:31.720
If the studio and Zhuling
want to collaborate,

19:31.720 --> 19:33.860
we need to provide financial reports
for Lyman to review.

19:33.860 --> 19:36.420
After all, they need to monitor
the safety of project funds.

19:36.420 --> 19:37.950
It's a reasonable request.

19:38.280 --> 19:39.210
This is my fault.

19:39.600 --> 19:41.600
I should have reported to you first.

19:42.500 --> 19:45.100
Securing the Lyman's project is
the priority.

19:46.400 --> 19:47.510
I'll tell Shen Jie

19:48.030 --> 19:49.890
to send you the financial report.

19:51.030 --> 19:51.510
Okay.

19:52.200 --> 19:53.530
I'll go upstairs first.

20:13.110 --> 20:13.830
Mr. Xiao.

20:17.110 --> 20:18.780
Zhuling has replied

20:18.810 --> 20:22.410
that their financial statement will be
sent to Lyman 2 days late.

20:24.030 --> 20:26.310
There's something else
I need to discuss with you.

20:26.310 --> 20:28.000
According
to the preliminary cooperation process,

20:28.000 --> 20:29.960
we need to send a liaison representative

20:29.960 --> 20:31.790
to the construction site
managed by Zhuling

20:31.790 --> 20:34.000
to conduct
a construction management inspection.

20:34.000 --> 20:35.790
Afterward, Zhuling will provide

20:35.790 --> 20:37.720
a complete list of suppliers

20:37.720 --> 20:38.850
for us to recommend.

20:40.200 --> 20:41.510
As for the liaison,

20:41.640 --> 20:42.470
Mr. Pei

20:42.500 --> 20:44.700
specifically wants Hu Xiu to follow up.

20:47.840 --> 20:51.040
Mr. Pei has been paying a lot of attention
to Hu Xiu lately.

20:51.900 --> 20:53.940
But if you think there's any issue,

20:53.970 --> 20:55.030
I can find a way to decline

20:55.030 --> 20:56.760
and send someone else instead.

20:57.070 --> 20:57.590
No,

20:58.440 --> 20:59.200
let her go.

21:00.030 --> 21:01.000
Recently,

21:01.510 --> 21:02.600
she's put in quite a lot of effort

21:02.600 --> 21:03.930
looking for suppliers.

21:04.720 --> 21:07.380
She's very familiar
with each one's situation.

21:07.550 --> 21:08.920
She is the best choice.

21:10.350 --> 21:11.270
Indeed.

21:12.030 --> 21:14.000
Regardless of how Pei Zhen treats her,

21:14.000 --> 21:15.960
we shouldn't ignore her contributions.

21:15.960 --> 21:18.020
Otherwise, it would be unfair to her.

21:18.680 --> 21:19.350
Besides,

21:20.310 --> 21:21.570
she can handle it well.

21:24.680 --> 21:26.350
Since she joined the company,

21:26.710 --> 21:29.770
her capabilities have been
self-evident to everyone.

21:32.790 --> 21:34.240
Zhou Yan from D Studio has replied,

21:34.240 --> 21:35.240
agreeing to let Ms. Hu

21:35.240 --> 21:36.770
handle the follow-up work.

21:39.830 --> 21:40.790
Director Shen?

21:41.400 --> 21:43.200
The Chairman is also here today?

21:44.350 --> 21:45.240
Director Shen.

21:47.940 --> 21:48.580
Mr. Pei.

21:49.440 --> 21:50.700
Did something happen?

21:51.680 --> 21:52.400
No.

21:52.870 --> 21:55.510
It's just that these documents are
a bit tricky to work on.

21:55.510 --> 21:56.510
Nothing serious.

21:57.350 --> 21:58.000
Mr. Pei,

21:58.310 --> 21:59.750
Chairman Pei just instructed me

21:59.750 --> 22:01.550
to sort out the financial report

22:01.640 --> 22:02.640
and give it to you.

22:03.000 --> 22:03.680
However,

22:04.200 --> 22:05.860
you'll need to wait a few days.

22:06.510 --> 22:07.160
okay.

22:16.580 --> 22:17.910
Go ahead with your work.

22:19.860 --> 22:21.130
[Chairman's Office]

22:30.070 --> 22:30.720
Hu Xiu.

22:31.600 --> 22:33.830
I'm assigning you
to coordinate with Zhuling.

22:33.830 --> 22:34.310
Later,

22:34.310 --> 22:37.270
you'll go with Mr. Pei
to inspect Zhuling's construction site.

22:37.270 --> 22:37.750
Well,

22:37.920 --> 22:39.350
will Hu Xiu be going alone?

22:39.350 --> 22:40.150
What about me?

22:40.350 --> 22:41.680
One person is enough.

22:41.790 --> 22:42.640
Besides,

22:43.000 --> 22:44.590
Mr. Pei specifically requested

22:44.590 --> 22:46.250
Hu Xiu to coordinate with him.

22:50.680 --> 22:51.920
What's all the fuss about?

22:51.920 --> 22:53.510
You don't have enough work to do

22:53.510 --> 22:54.970
and want to work overtime?

22:59.640 --> 23:01.070
Both Mr. Xiao and I

23:01.070 --> 23:02.790
trust your work skills completely.

23:02.790 --> 23:03.880
Do your best.

23:04.310 --> 23:06.880
If there's anything inappropriate

23:07.440 --> 23:08.570
from Mr. Pei's side,

23:08.590 --> 23:09.990
let me know immediately.

23:11.640 --> 23:12.240
Good luck.

23:20.440 --> 23:21.030
Hu Xiu,

23:21.640 --> 23:23.000
I've noticed something.

23:23.000 --> 23:24.480
Mr. Pei treats you

23:24.880 --> 23:26.270
quite differently.

23:26.510 --> 23:27.310
No.

23:27.310 --> 23:28.540
Yes!

23:28.560 --> 23:30.230
Sun told us last time

23:30.750 --> 23:32.270
that at the Lyman's cocktail party,

23:32.270 --> 23:34.250
Mr. Pei specifically invited you to dance.

23:34.250 --> 23:35.970
You two looked like a perfect match.

23:35.970 --> 23:37.770
Wait, why are you giving me away?

23:38.360 --> 23:39.070
Sun Yifei.

23:40.400 --> 23:41.510
I've finished
reviewing the materials for you.

23:41.510 --> 23:42.110
You're just way too idle.

23:42.110 --> 23:44.550
Hey, but what I said is backed
by evidence.

23:44.790 --> 23:45.720
During the meeting that day,

23:45.720 --> 23:47.070
Mr. Pei gave us gifts, right?

23:47.070 --> 23:48.830
He was giving very formal gifts
to the rest of us.

23:48.830 --> 23:49.030
Yep.

23:49.030 --> 23:50.290
But when it came to you,

23:50.440 --> 23:51.440
it was chocolate.

23:51.510 --> 23:52.830
How sweet and romantic.

23:52.830 --> 23:53.670
Right?

23:55.050 --> 23:56.960
Isn't it still sitting at your desk?

23:56.960 --> 23:58.640
You quite value it, don't you?

23:58.900 --> 24:00.240
And you put it on the left side,

24:00.240 --> 24:02.000
the closest to your heart.

24:02.000 --> 24:03.130
Value it? Nonsense!

24:03.200 --> 24:03.880
I put it there,

24:03.880 --> 24:05.310
so everyone can share it.

24:05.410 --> 24:06.370
Come on.

24:06.920 --> 24:07.830
L-Let me share it with you all.

24:07.830 --> 24:09.190
There's chocolate to eat!

24:09.190 --> 24:10.850
-Then give me one.
-I want one.

24:10.920 --> 24:11.920
That's not what I meant.

24:11.920 --> 24:13.750
I saw you laughing heartily just now.

24:13.750 --> 24:15.360
I won't give any to you two either.

24:15.360 --> 24:16.220
Here, catch it.

24:29.240 --> 24:31.110
We're celebrating
our store's second anniversary.

24:31.110 --> 24:32.830
Here's a customized gift for you.

24:32.830 --> 24:34.880
We specifically asked a designer
to design it.

24:34.880 --> 24:36.230
It's exclusive to our store.

24:36.230 --> 24:36.960
Here you are.

24:37.110 --> 24:38.510
You can put it in your café.

24:38.510 --> 24:40.510
Happy second wedding anniversary.

25:35.200 --> 25:37.060
I was charging my phone
in your car earlier

25:37.060 --> 25:38.870
and forgot to take my cable.

25:39.350 --> 25:40.560
When can you return it to me?

25:40.560 --> 25:42.400
It's only charged to 60 percent.

25:42.430 --> 25:44.190
Can you stay longer next time?

25:44.510 --> 25:46.730
It's said that unplugging your phone
before it's fully charged

25:46.730 --> 25:48.380
affects the battery life.

25:53.500 --> 25:54.310
Chi Xin.

25:54.330 --> 25:55.270
Do you remember her?

25:55.270 --> 25:56.350
At the networking event back then,

25:56.350 --> 25:58.160
Chi Xin specifically came over

25:58.560 --> 26:00.090
to add Guangming on WeChat.

26:00.100 --> 26:01.480
Guangming refused her immediately.

26:01.480 --> 26:02.640
Later, she came to me

26:02.750 --> 26:04.680
and asked me to give her his WeChat.

26:11.510 --> 26:12.530
Go get some more sleep.

26:12.530 --> 26:13.530
It's still early.

26:13.960 --> 26:14.550
No way.

26:14.550 --> 26:16.480
I thought of some new desserts last night.

26:16.480 --> 26:18.740
I need to give them a try
at the shop today.

26:20.770 --> 26:22.290
Why am I feeling so drowsy?

26:28.660 --> 26:29.750
You did that on purpose, didn't you?

26:29.750 --> 26:31.080
I'm helping you wake up.

26:35.170 --> 26:36.880
That monitoring system you developed is

26:36.880 --> 26:38.080
actually pretty good.

26:38.080 --> 26:40.100
There's a project we're planning to launch

26:40.100 --> 26:42.140
that's similar to what you're doing.

26:42.140 --> 26:44.140
Let's talk about it in person later.

26:46.210 --> 26:47.660
You didn't eat much.

26:49.550 --> 26:51.280
Senior, I'll be there shortly.

26:51.500 --> 26:53.680
I've brought all the project materials.

26:53.680 --> 26:54.480
What's wrong?

26:54.920 --> 26:55.850
Just a spam text.

27:02.180 --> 27:03.110
Senior,

27:03.200 --> 27:03.830
you made me come all this way

27:03.830 --> 27:05.440
just to be your driver?

27:05.680 --> 27:06.680
Let's find a place

27:07.390 --> 27:08.720
to discuss the project.

27:20.060 --> 27:21.830
My client is back from Germany

27:21.850 --> 27:23.650
and wants to explore
Shanghai's snack shops.

27:23.650 --> 27:24.910
Are you free to join us?

27:25.010 --> 27:25.610
Yes, I'm free.

27:25.610 --> 27:27.540
I submitted my resignation today.

27:27.930 --> 27:28.930
That's great.

27:28.960 --> 27:31.120
Now you can focus on our project.

27:31.570 --> 27:33.280
Honey, what brings you here?

27:35.440 --> 27:38.860
Should we go to the double-rice cake store
or the pan-fried bun restaurant first?

27:38.860 --> 27:41.100
I haven't had carbs like these in ages.

27:46.200 --> 27:47.720
The project is going so smoothly.

27:47.720 --> 27:50.050
Don't you think I deserve a little reward?

27:50.480 --> 27:51.070
Honey,

27:51.200 --> 27:52.470
I was suddenly invited
to a business dinner tonight.

27:52.470 --> 27:53.000
Get some rest early.

27:53.000 --> 27:55.370
I just saw many people
still waiting outside.

27:55.370 --> 27:58.070
You must've lined up for quite a while
for this restaurant, huh?

27:58.070 --> 27:59.160
It's nothing.

27:59.160 --> 28:01.890
I really appreciate your help
with this project.

28:05.240 --> 28:06.030
Hello, sir.

28:06.030 --> 28:07.160
Here's your receipt.

28:07.160 --> 28:08.790
It's 1,314 yuan in total.

28:08.790 --> 28:09.310
Okay.

28:09.310 --> 28:09.720
Also,

28:09.720 --> 28:11.440
today is our store's second anniversary.

28:11.440 --> 28:13.770
This is a special customized gift for you.

28:15.390 --> 28:16.590
Second anniversary?

29:07.590 --> 29:08.350
Honey?

29:08.980 --> 29:10.710
You didn't go to the shop today?

29:16.970 --> 29:18.530
I-I didn't sleep well.

29:18.650 --> 29:20.410
I want to get some rest at home.

29:27.070 --> 29:28.640
Did I wake you up when I came home

29:28.640 --> 29:29.830
this morning?

29:43.970 --> 29:45.830
Are you going to the office today?

29:47.270 --> 29:48.830
Yes, I'm leaving now.

29:49.510 --> 29:50.770
Go get some more sleep.

29:51.390 --> 29:52.150
I'm off.

30:17.160 --> 30:17.720
Sir,

30:17.720 --> 30:18.510
I called this taxi.

30:18.510 --> 30:19.870
Please follow that car in front closely.

30:19.870 --> 30:20.390
Okay.

31:00.690 --> 31:02.140
Sleeping in this late,

31:02.870 --> 31:04.400
you haven't eaten yet, huh?

31:05.830 --> 31:06.590
Thanks.

31:07.220 --> 31:09.020
Your lunch break is really long.

31:09.840 --> 31:10.920
Thanks to you.

31:11.830 --> 31:13.510
I told my boss I was coming out for work,

31:13.510 --> 31:14.880
so he let me go.

31:15.200 --> 31:17.400
After all these meetings this morning,

31:17.970 --> 31:19.900
my battery has been running low.

31:20.270 --> 31:21.680
If I didn't come out for some fresh air,

31:21.680 --> 31:22.830
I'd shut down.

31:27.430 --> 31:28.760
Take it for recharging.

31:30.110 --> 31:30.960
Just this?

31:50.960 --> 31:52.690
This is what I call recharging.

32:21.110 --> 32:22.590
Zhuling's financial statement

32:22.590 --> 32:24.250
hasn't been sent to Lyman yet.

32:24.440 --> 32:26.600
They said
it would be delayed by 2 more days.

32:26.600 --> 32:28.030
Zhuling is a large enterprise

32:28.030 --> 32:29.050
with complex finances.

32:29.050 --> 32:30.310
It's understandable.

32:31.110 --> 32:32.640
Then I'll follow up on this.

32:33.350 --> 32:35.270
Hu Xiu went out

32:35.400 --> 32:38.400
to inspect Zhuling's construction site
with Mr. Pei.

32:50.310 --> 32:51.270
Ms. Hu,

32:51.430 --> 32:52.690
can't get a taxi again?

32:55.350 --> 32:56.030
Mr. Pei,

32:56.200 --> 32:58.830
weren't we supposed to meet
at the construction site?

32:58.830 --> 33:00.350
I had some things to handle nearby.

33:00.350 --> 33:01.170
Since it's on my way anyway,

33:01.170 --> 33:02.230
let's go together.

33:10.930 --> 33:12.430
[We're calling 7 types of cars for you.]

33:13.560 --> 33:14.570
Thank you, Mr. Pei.

33:14.570 --> 33:15.640
To avoid being late,

33:15.640 --> 33:17.710
I'll gladly accept your offer.

33:33.260 --> 33:33.870
Coffee.

33:40.900 --> 33:43.110
Mr. Pei, you've been waiting for me
for a while, right?

33:43.110 --> 33:44.200
Why do you say that?

33:45.550 --> 33:47.480
The coffee isn't even hot anymore.

33:50.030 --> 33:50.750
It's fine.

33:51.060 --> 33:52.920
It's only been about half an hour.

33:54.270 --> 33:56.070
It's rare for you to wait
for someone, Mr. Pei.

33:56.070 --> 33:57.650
Then I won't refuse your kindness.

33:57.650 --> 33:59.110
Thank you for treating me.

34:04.720 --> 34:06.550
When I suggested you as the liaison,

34:06.550 --> 34:08.610
I thought Xiao Zhiyu wouldn't agree.

34:09.590 --> 34:10.760
Since we're going to work together,

34:10.760 --> 34:11.840
there will surely be

34:11.840 --> 34:13.500
plenty of coordination work.

34:13.710 --> 34:15.550
Mr. Pei,
you don't need to go to such trouble,

34:15.550 --> 34:17.409
picking me up and dropping me off.

34:17.909 --> 34:21.040
Seems like you want to draw the line
with me again, Ms. Hu.

34:21.920 --> 34:22.800
Yes, of course.

34:23.090 --> 34:25.650
I don't want to become
part of office gossip.

34:27.110 --> 34:28.110
What gossip?

34:29.239 --> 34:30.030
They say

34:30.130 --> 34:32.070
you specifically requested me
to coordinate with you

34:32.070 --> 34:33.400
because you're into me.

34:37.150 --> 34:38.480
It's fine. Don't worry.

34:44.510 --> 34:45.230
Well, then,

34:45.889 --> 34:47.000
what do you think?

34:49.880 --> 34:50.510
Mr. Pei,

34:51.040 --> 34:52.730
I know my place.

34:53.550 --> 34:54.320
I know

34:54.830 --> 34:56.560
your focus has never been on me,

34:57.070 --> 34:58.070
but on Xiao Zhiyu.

35:00.480 --> 35:01.960
What makes you say that?

35:02.440 --> 35:04.270
Mr. Pei, your time is too valuable

35:04.270 --> 35:06.730
to waste
on insignificant people or things.

35:07.150 --> 35:08.800
As a nobody,

35:09.150 --> 35:11.230
the only reason I caught your attention

35:11.230 --> 35:13.760
must be my relationship with Xiao Zhiyu.

35:17.590 --> 35:19.110
You used me to probe him,

35:19.400 --> 35:21.260
wanted to provoke him through me,

35:21.320 --> 35:22.980
and smeared him in front of me.

35:23.590 --> 35:25.030
I couldn't figure it out before.

35:25.030 --> 35:26.710
It was just business competition.

35:26.710 --> 35:28.640
Why were you targeting him so much?

35:30.880 --> 35:33.410
But after learning
about your family matters

35:33.510 --> 35:35.640
and the relationship between you two,

35:36.150 --> 35:37.680
it finally made some sense.

35:40.630 --> 35:42.230
Seems like I'm a villain

35:42.960 --> 35:44.320
in your eyes, Ms. Hu.

35:46.030 --> 35:48.550
I just want to do my job well.

35:50.360 --> 35:51.620
What about Xiao Zhiyu?

35:52.510 --> 35:53.760
Does he also see you

35:53.760 --> 35:55.420
as just an ordinary employee?

35:58.400 --> 35:59.260
Yes, of course.

36:02.070 --> 36:03.710
Mr. Xiao

36:03.710 --> 36:05.110
respects his employees.

36:05.400 --> 36:06.070
He wouldn't deprive

36:06.070 --> 36:08.070
any employee of work opportunities

36:08.440 --> 36:11.030
due to the current conflicts
between you two.

36:13.150 --> 36:14.150
So, Mr. Pei,

36:14.920 --> 36:16.480
please don't use me

36:16.480 --> 36:18.480
as a tool in your family infighting.

36:24.190 --> 36:25.710
I never realized before

36:26.280 --> 36:27.880
that you're so blunt, Ms. Hu.

36:29.110 --> 36:30.770
Do you feel offended, Mr. Pei?

36:33.590 --> 36:34.880
I'm just surprised.

36:37.840 --> 36:39.700
You used to work as a GM assistant.

36:40.150 --> 36:42.480
I thought you would be someone diplomatic

36:43.000 --> 36:44.860
and cautious in handling things.

36:46.190 --> 36:48.050
My idea of being diplomatic isn't

36:48.230 --> 36:50.840
carefully crafting lies,

36:51.760 --> 36:52.710
but rather

36:54.920 --> 36:56.580
speaking the truth politely.

37:00.840 --> 37:03.040
It seems that I don't know you very well.

37:04.960 --> 37:06.420
Well, that being the case,

37:06.960 --> 37:09.420
let's formally get to know
each other today.

37:10.110 --> 37:10.760
Mr. Pei,

37:11.480 --> 37:13.740
we'll be working side by side from now on.

37:13.840 --> 37:15.150
I hope that between us,

37:15.360 --> 37:16.710
there can be less pretense

37:16.710 --> 37:17.840
and more sincerity,

37:18.400 --> 37:20.730
so we can get this project done perfectly.

37:30.880 --> 37:31.610
Sounds good.

37:48.760 --> 37:49.620
Here they come.

37:56.000 --> 37:56.440
Mr. Pei,

37:56.440 --> 37:57.150
welcome.

37:57.320 --> 37:58.180
Supervisor Xu.

37:59.150 --> 38:00.480
Thank you for your work.

38:01.630 --> 38:02.830
Let me introduce you.

38:02.880 --> 38:03.800
This is Supervisor Xu from Zhuling,

38:03.800 --> 38:04.920
in charge of the project engineering.

38:04.920 --> 38:05.590
Hello, Supervisor Xu.

38:05.590 --> 38:07.760
I'm Hu Xiu,
an assistant designer from D Studio.

38:07.760 --> 38:09.590
Ms. Hu, welcome to inspect our site.

38:09.590 --> 38:10.510
You're too kind.

38:10.510 --> 38:11.110
Zhuling's construction sites

38:11.110 --> 38:13.220
have always set the standard
in the industry.

38:13.220 --> 38:15.220
I'm actually here to learn from you.

38:26.450 --> 38:28.050
Mr. Pei needs to get changed.

38:28.230 --> 38:29.840
He puts a set of clothes here

38:29.840 --> 38:31.110
as he comes here to inspect every day.

38:31.110 --> 38:32.110
For convenience.

38:32.280 --> 38:33.610
You come here every day?

38:33.920 --> 38:35.050
Seems like you don't

38:35.050 --> 38:36.510
know me very well, either.

38:36.970 --> 38:37.830
Take your time.

38:39.870 --> 38:41.470
I'll take Ms. Hu there first.

38:41.920 --> 38:42.380
Come on.

38:42.920 --> 38:43.920
This way, please.

38:45.800 --> 38:46.330
Let's go.

38:47.230 --> 38:47.800
Ms. Hu,

38:47.960 --> 38:49.570
let me give you a brief introduction.

38:49.570 --> 38:50.520
This construction site is

38:49.930 --> 38:52.490
♪ Think about you ♪

38:50.550 --> 38:51.110
currently

38:51.110 --> 38:53.000
one of our largest sites
under construction.

38:52.530 --> 38:54.570
♪ Care about you ♪

38:54.600 --> 38:56.600
♪ Goodnight to you ♪

38:57.190 --> 38:59.570
♪ All night long for you ♪

38:59.730 --> 39:02.070
♪ Think about you ♪

39:02.310 --> 39:04.720
♪ Care about you ♪

39:05.120 --> 39:06.880
♪ Goodnight to you ♪

39:07.330 --> 39:09.900
♪ All night long for you ♪

39:10.310 --> 39:11.900
♪ Think about you ♪

39:12.280 --> 39:14.330
♪ Care about you ♪

39:14.930 --> 39:16.930
♪ Goodnight to you ♪

39:17.540 --> 39:20.090
♪ All night long for you ♪

39:20.120 --> 39:22.120
♪ Think about you ♪

39:22.700 --> 39:24.740
♪ Care about you ♪

39:25.020 --> 39:27.020
♪ Goodnight to you ♪

39:27.670 --> 39:30.050
♪ All night long for you ♪

39:28.880 --> 39:30.090
The external elevators

39:30.090 --> 39:31.490
and the material hoists.

39:31.670 --> 39:33.030
The safety gates
of these unloading platforms

39:33.030 --> 39:34.400
must be closed according to regulations.

39:34.400 --> 39:35.280
We can't be careless.

39:35.280 --> 39:36.360
Don't worry, Mr. Pei.

39:36.360 --> 39:37.960
Yes, you remind us of it
every time you come.

39:37.960 --> 39:38.800
I'm keeping a close eye on it.

39:38.800 --> 39:39.590
There won't be any slip-ups.

39:39.590 --> 39:40.800
Familiarity breeds neglect.

39:40.800 --> 39:43.400
These reminders
can never be repeated enough.

39:43.490 --> 39:45.510
There cannot be any accidents on site.

39:45.510 --> 39:46.630
Safety is our bottom line.

39:46.630 --> 39:47.150
Understood.

39:47.150 --> 39:47.710
Yes.

39:47.840 --> 39:48.750
You may get back to work now.

39:48.750 --> 39:50.410
Please rest assured, Mr. Pei.

39:55.190 --> 39:55.960
Ms. Hu.

39:59.480 --> 39:59.960
What is it?

39:59.960 --> 40:01.510
Did you notice any problems?

40:01.510 --> 40:02.110
Nope.

40:02.550 --> 40:04.950
Zhuling really lives up to its reputation.

40:05.630 --> 40:06.630
What reputation?

40:07.760 --> 40:08.440
Everyone says

40:08.440 --> 40:09.400
Zhuling's construction sites

40:09.400 --> 40:11.110
have the most standardized management

40:11.110 --> 40:12.770
and the best safety measures.

40:13.670 --> 40:14.980
Isn't it the most basic principle

40:14.980 --> 40:16.620
to ensure workers' safety?

40:18.760 --> 40:21.620
If only every construction site
could follow this.

40:22.510 --> 40:23.150
What?

40:23.230 --> 40:24.710
Did you encounter any problems

40:24.710 --> 40:26.770
with your previous projects, Ms. Hu?

40:28.230 --> 40:29.290
It was about my dad.

40:30.030 --> 40:31.960
He used to be a lighting engineer,

40:32.280 --> 40:34.850
responsible for lighting installations
in many large venues.

40:34.850 --> 40:37.180
He was injured in a construction accident.

40:37.180 --> 40:38.710
It happened many years ago.

40:39.320 --> 40:40.510
Accidents at construction sites are

40:40.510 --> 40:42.040
always life-threatening.

40:42.110 --> 40:43.530
Although your father was injured,

40:43.530 --> 40:45.990
he actually lucked out
given the situation.

40:46.710 --> 40:48.170
But as long as one is alive,

40:48.550 --> 40:49.550
there is hope.

41:05.900 --> 41:06.430
Mr. Xiao,

41:06.800 --> 41:07.990
I'm clocking out.

41:09.440 --> 41:10.120
Well...

41:11.960 --> 41:12.800
Is Hu Xiu

41:12.800 --> 41:14.580
still not done
inspecting the construction site?

41:14.580 --> 41:15.910
I just called and asked.

41:16.040 --> 41:17.590
She said the inspection was over,

41:17.590 --> 41:20.190
but she needed to go
to Zhuling with Mr. Pei.
